1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:12,590
When people say relationships require work, what I've realized and learned is that the work that they're talking about is not really even work on the relationship.

2
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:14,590
It's work on you.

3
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:22,480
Because however you showed up is never enough.

4
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:27,480
Because, I mean, you didn't necessarily know what you needed once you got to the place, right?

5
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:35,420
So then you got to work on you to get to the place that you wanted to be in.

6
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,200
And that's what self-love is.

7
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:44,060
Self-love is the attention that you give to yourself to allow yourself to experience joy.

8
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:56,660
Because when people say they're like battling their demons, what they're really battling is the trauma that they experienced becoming the person they are.

